# KOReader v2026.07.1: all files access given, so it can open books anywhere on the cards
# (EASYROMS too) without stopping at Android's "All files access" page on the first start.
# Only once: if the user takes it away it stays away. See ../../README.md,
# "First-start settings".
package org.koreader.launcher.fdroid
appop MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE allow
